## bedrock-core's own guide. Served by @bedrock-core/config from a hand-written manifest, so its
## prose lives here rather than being generated by the guides filter. Keys stay short on purpose:
## a key travels to the client as a string and the form serializer caps those at 80 bytes, while
## the value it resolves to has no such limit.
## Admonition titles. The guides filter writes these for a generated guide; a hand-written
## manifest has to carry its own, and the renderer falls back to the raw key without them.
